<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EXEL raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EXEL raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co analyst Alice Schroeder confirmed that she raised her rating on EXEL Ltd to outperform from market perform, calling it a high quality stock with attractive valuations.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We believe it is a good defensive play as the insurance industry enters an increasingly competitive market,&quot; she said.</p>
</text>
